 do tomorrow?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Oh! We could go to Chocolate Week! A true San Francisco tradition!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Ooh! Chocolate! Exciting! Where is it?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: It's all over town. There is an information counter right here!", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-130\">Chocolate Sales Rep</span>:  Would you like to know more about Chocolate Week?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Of course! Why do you ask?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chocolate Sales Rep</span>: I work at Giovanelli's Chocolate Factory.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Interesting ... Tell me more!", "time": "18000"}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-130\">Chocolate Sales Rep</span>: Just walk down San Francisco's streets any day this week. There are many stalls filled with all kinds of world-famous brands. You can taste and buy your favorite chocolates. Giovanelli's is the best, of course!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmm ... Why should I believe you?", "time": "31000"}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob06re2img02.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-130\">Chocolate Sales Rep</span>: Would you like a tour of our factory? You could sample our products straight from the source!<br>\n<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-130\">Vanessa</span>: I am so there! When could we go?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chocolate Sales Rep</span>: This form has all the details. You should take one!", "time": "49000"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le02ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le02ob06re6aud01", "images": [], "coverimg": "engenn4le02ob06re6img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type":